WEBVTT

00:29:57.996 --> 00:30:04.621
So he also felt that a woman might
be more patient on the field.

00:30:04.621 --> 00:30:07.913
So I was really lucky in
those ways, you know?

00:30:09.579 --> 00:30:13.538
I think so, too, although it poses
challenges then over time,

00:30:13.538 --> 00:30:17.829
as you get older and you become more
steeped in the assumptions of the field.

00:30:17.829 --> 00:30:23.121
There's there's a term in my world called
cognitive entrenchment where experts

00:30:23.121 --> 00:30:25.704
start to take for granted assumptions
that need to be questioned.

00:30:26.538 --> 00:30:29.496
How have you prevented yourself from
getting entrenched over the years?